{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Temporal.Instant</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"hegel","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Hegel","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Generators","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Temporal","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Instant","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Instants.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> t</span><span> = </span><span>{</span></code><ol><li id=\"type-t.second\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.second\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>second : int;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.nanosecond\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.nanosecond\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>nanosecond : int;</span></code></li></ol><code><span>}</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>An instant: <code>second</code>s since the Unix epoch, between the first second of the year -999999 and the last of 999999, and a <code>nanosecond</code> in <code>[0, 999999999]</code> counted forward from that second, so -1.5 s is <code>{ second = -2; nanosecond = 500_000_000 }</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-min_value\"><a href=\"#val-min_value\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> min_value : <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The first instant, <code>-999999-01-01T00:00:00Z</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-max_value\"><a href=\"#val-max_value\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> max_value : <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The last instant, <code>+999999-12-31T23:59:59.999999999Z</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-to_string\"><a href=\"#val-to_string\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> to_string : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>to_string instant</code> formats <code>instant</code> as a UTC date and time with a <code>Z</code> suffix: <code>2000-01-01T00:00:00Z</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-pp\"><a href=\"#val-pp\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> pp : <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.Format.formatter <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>pp formatter instant</code> prints <code>to_string instant</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-sexp_of_t\"><a href=\"#val-sexp_of_t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> sexp_of_t : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Sexplib0</span>.Sexp.t</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>sexp_of_t instant</code> is <code>to_string instant</code> as an atom.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-equal\"><a href=\"#val-equal\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> equal : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>equal a b</code> returns whether <code>a</code> and <code>b</code> have the same fields.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-compare\"><a href=\"#val-compare\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> compare : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>compare a b</code> orders valid instants chronologically.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-hegel_generator\"><a href=\"#val-hegel_generator\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> hegel_generator : <span><span>(<a href=\"#type-t\">t</a>, <a href=\"../../index.html#type-printable\">printable</a>)</span> <a href=\"../../index.html#type-generator\">generator</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>instants ()</code>, every instant.</p></div></div>"}